# LV3WizardPrivate (27253, level 76), raised for the character 50 away (spawn parameters character, character, owner),
# every draw 0: as it appears, lifetime 3 or under, it attacks the character (300). Its 1 s timer, the character inside 100,
# wants its self range blast (4529-1) on itself (1000000) and adds 50 to the attack. When the blast ends it drops its attack desires and,
# on a draw under 50 with the character inside 200, wants its second blast (4530-1) on the character; when that cast ends it dies.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.LV3Monster.LV3Monster
script script.ai.individual.Monster.LV3Monster.LV3PartyPrivateMonster
script script.ai.individual.Monster.LV3Monster.LV3WizardPrivate
npc owner 20003 Monster 600 0 0
npc wiz 27253 Monster 50 0 0 level 76 skill SELF_RANGE_DD_MAGIC1 4529 1 skill SELF_RANGE_DD_MAGIC2 4530 1 skill SELF_RANGE_DD_MAGIC3 4531 1 params character character owner master owner

tick
  desires wiz attack(player)=300
advance 1s
  desires wiz attack(player)=350 cast(wiz,4529,move)=1000000
tick x4
  S MagicSkillUse caster=wiz target=wiz skill=4529-1 hit=0 reuse=21142 success=0
advance 3s
  S MagicSkillUse caster=wiz target=wiz skill=4530-1 hit=0 reuse=21142 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=1067 0:"" 1:1
  dead wiz yes
